  "SM_002140_0100_NAR": "[RUBY:BASE ]相手[RUBY:BEGIN ]あいて[RUBY:END ]がヒトダマだとわかって、\r\nセレッサの[RUBY:BASE ]口[RUBY:BEGIN ]くち[RUBY:END ]も[RUBY:BASE ]自然[RUBY:BEGIN ]しぜん[RUBY:END ]と[RUBY:BASE ]軽[RUBY:BEGIN ]かる[RUBY:END ]くなります。",
  "SM_002130_0150_FAS": "「そこでは[RUBY:BASE ]狂[RUBY:BEGIN ]くる[RUBY:END ]った[RUBY:BASE ]団長[RUBY:BEGIN ]だんちょう[RUBY:END ]が\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]今[RUBY:BEGIN ]いま[RUBY:END ]も[RUBY:BASE ]一人[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひとり[RUBY:END ]で[RUBY:BASE ]興行[RUBY:BEGIN ]こうぎょう[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]続[RUBY:BEGIN ]つづ[RUBY:END ]けていて、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]彼[RUBY:BEGIN ]かれ[RUBY:END ]に[RUBY:BASE ]見[RUBY:BEGIN ]み[RUBY:END ]つかったが[RUBY:BASE ]最後[RUBY:BEGIN ]さいご[RUBY:END ]。\r\n\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]死[RUBY:BEGIN ]し[RUBY:END ]ぬまでサーカスに\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]付[RUBY:BEGIN ]つ[RUBY:END ]き[RUBY:BASE ]合[RUBY:BEGIN ]あ[RUBY:END ]わされてしまうのさ」",
